% The 17 scalars include five separate healthy-phase RMS currents and signed
% current/voltage excesses. Excess = measured peak minus its prescribed cap;
% it is not a clipped or corrected value. Voltage comparisons allow 2e-8 V;
% other scalar errors allow 2e-10 in their own units. Parseval separately checks
% the RMS calculation without substituting its result into the display.
